        },
        "notes": "Flavor notes: Bright, Citrus, Grassy, Herbal, Lemon, Lime, Refreshing, Tangy, Vibrant, Zesty\n\nJ-Lime hops, an experimental variety with limited release, bring a burst of unique flavors to the world of brewing. Originating from a lineage of innovative hop breeding programs, J-Lime hops offer a distinct aroma profile characterized by a grassy citrus scent coupled with pronounced lemon and lime notes. J-Lime hops shine in both ales and lagers, adding complexity and vibrancy to the final product. The grassy lime flavor intertwines harmoniously with the zesty citrus undertones, resulting in a refreshing and invigorating experience for the palate."
      },
      {
        "name": "Jester",
        "hop_type": "aroma",
        "origin": "Great Britain",
        "folder_path": "Great Britain",
        "alpha_acid": {
          "unit": "%",
          "value": 8.0
        },
