        "notes": "Flavor notes: Citrus, Mint, Orange, Pine, Resinous, Tropical Fruits\n\nHS10416 is an exciting experimental hop from Hopsteiner, with a genetic lineage tracing back to Bravo, Serebrianka, and Wye Target . This high alpha-acid hop is making waves in the brewing world with its distinctive aroma profile, boasting enticing notes of orange, citrus, pine resin, mint, and tropical fruits. Its unique blend of flavors makes it a versatile choice for homebrewers looking to infuse their creations with a burst of citrusy freshness and a hint of minty coolness. Ideal for brewing pale ales and IPAs, HS10416 adds a dynamic layer of aroma and flavor to the beer, elevating it to new heights."
