        "notes": "Flavor notes: Citrus, Lemon, Melon, Pear, Pine\n\nCF184 hops, an experimental variety hailing from the UK, were the brainchild of the Charles Faram Hop Development Programme. Released in limited quantities in 2020, sadly, its availability has waned, rendering it a rare find for those seeking to incorporate its distinct characteristics into their brews. Characterized by aromas reminiscent of lemon, pear, and pine, CF184 adds a refreshing and complex dimension to beer. Its flavor notes extend beyond the initial aroma, with hints of melon and citrus dancing on the palate."
