        "notes": "Flavor notes: Citrus, Floral, Fruity, Marmalade, Stone Fruit, Sweet\n\nCF185 hops, an experimental variety hailing from the UK and cultivated through the Charles Faram Hop Development Programme, made a brief but notable appearance in the brewing scene with a limited release in 2020. Unfortunately, these hops are no longer available, adding to their mystique among brewers. CF185 hops offered a delightful combination of nice stone fruit and marmalade notes, which lent themselves beautifully to English pale ales and IPAs ."
