          },
          "maximum": {
            "unit": "%",
            "value": 5.8
          }
        },
        "notes": "Flavor notes: Aromatic, Balanced, Floral, Fresh, Herbal, Spicy\n\nThe Edelweiss hop blend is a distinctive combination of six US-grown hops, specifically crafted to complement a range of beers including pilsners, dorts, lagers, and hefs. This blend is a harmonious fusion of traditional lager hops, with 67% of its flavors reminiscent of German hops and 33% echoing the essence of Czech hops. As a result, when used in brewing, it offers a unique hop flavor that positions the beer somewhere between a German and Bohemian Pilsner . The flavor profile of the Edelweiss hop blend is primarily floral, complemented by a pleasant spiciness that seamlessly melds the flavors together."
