          }
        },
        "notes": "Also known as: GLH-8582\n\nFlavor notes: Candy, Eucalyptus, Fruity, Honeydew, Lemon, Mandarin, Rosemary, Strawberry\n\nGemini hops, originating from the United States, are gaining popularity in the brewing world due to their versatility and unique flavor profile. Suitable for multiple brewing stages, they offer a rich blend of aromas like strawberry, candy, and mandarin. This hop is not limited in its applications, allowing brewers to experiment and enhance their brews' flavors. Its growing popularity underscores its potential to enrich the beer's sensory experience, making it an interesting choice for passionate brewers."
      },
      {
        "name": "Glacier",
        "hop_type": "aroma/bittering",
        "origin": "United States",
        "folder_path": "United States",
        "alpha_acid": {
          "unit": "%",
          "value": 5.6
        },
        "alpha_acid_range": {
          "minimum": {
            "unit": "%",
            "value": 4.4
          },
          "maximum": {
            "unit": "%",
            "value": 7.0
          }
        },
        "beta_acid": {
          "unit": "%",
