        "notes": "Flavor notes: Apricot, Fig, Gooseberry, Guava, Lemon, Lime, Orange, Passion Fruit, Peach, Pineapple\n\nNewZilla is a vibrant, proprietary blend of New Zealand-grown hops developed by Hop Alliance in collaboration with Pikimai Hops. Originating from the lush hop-growing region of Tapawera, this blend unites several premium NZ varieties into a single, consistent hop offering. Designed to meet the demands of modern hop-forward beer styles, NewZilla delivers a potent mix of tropical, citrus, and stone fruit aromas, making it a go-to choice for homebrewers looking to craft juicy IPAs, Hazy Pale Ales, and other fruit-forward ales."
