        "notes": "Flavor notes: Citrus, Exotic, Fruity, Juicy, Lime, Melon, Passion Fruit, Refreshing, Tropical Fruits, Zesty\n\nNZL-32 hops, cultivated by Freestyle Hops, offer a unique flavor profile that can elevate your homebrew to new heights. These hops originate from New Zealand, a region known for its pristine landscapes and innovative hop varieties. NZL-32 is no exception, boasting field aromas of passion fruit, lime, and candied melon that can transport your senses to a tropical paradise with each sip. Whether you're crafting a refreshing pale ale, a zesty IPA, or even experimenting with a fruit-forward saison, these hops can impart a distinct character that sets your brew apart."
