        },
        "notes": "Fermoale AY3 is a dry ale yeast from AEB that features high flocculation. The ideal fermentation temperature range for Fermoale AY3 is 14.0-22.0 °C, making it well suited for many styles of beer and other beverages. Its high flocculation properties ensure that only the desired flavors are present in the finished product, while unwanted by-products are efficiently removed. Fermoale AY3 is a reliable choice when brewing any type of ale or lager to provide consistent results with each batch."
      },
